{"skill":{"slug":"supermemory","displayName":"Supermemory"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769623551710,"changelog":"Initial release of SuperMemory skill.\n\n- Store, search, and chat with your personal knowledge base using the SuperMemory API.\n- Add content to your memory store with optional descriptions.\n- Search your memories by query.\n- Chat conversationally with your memory database.\n- Simple bash commands for memory management.\n- Requires configuration of the SUPERMEMORY_API_KEY environment variable.","changelogSource":"auto","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":2252,"sha256":"294cf26f89e4ca280f4e32317fdbbc54877cd431c4319072394c127db8fe581e","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"scripts/add-memory.sh","size":1537,"sha256":"12d27a6f844192a15ec682a17a2a82473dbfbb0e9e746a19ab2fe706b7026f4a","contentType":"application/x-sh"},{"path":"scripts/chat.sh","size":1690,"sha256":"eda5c7a1db0a61c4866c759ca640056ebc8d0c9bb725874b800ec4bf564cdf97","contentType":"application/x-sh"},{"path":"scripts/search.sh","size":1056,"sha256":"4f5fcae8f360763d01d94dd362be3bde3d997716117e26670993259601096067","contentType":"application/x-sh"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2227,"sha256":"e0c83d173542ed85f0b547a088dfdd922703b6080980e8864c788be73178eebe","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"suspicious","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789022944843,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"1adb79def88f4df5d90f4feb450041052c1c92abcbd8e3c41a80f144e220f7e5","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/1adb79def88f4df5d90f4feb450041052c1c92abcbd8e3c41a80f144e220f7e5","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: supermemory\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\nThe skill bundle is designed to interact with the SuperMemory API for storing, searching, and chatting with memories. All network calls are directed to the legitimate `api.supermemory.ai` domain, and the `SUPERMEMORY_API_KEY` is explicitly required for authentication. There is no evidence of data exfiltration beyond the intended API interaction, malicious execution, persistence mechanisms, or prompt injection attempts against the agent. While user input is directly embedded into JSON payloads without explicit escaping, this is primarily a robustness concern that could lead to malformed JSON and API errors, rather than a direct security vulnerability like shell injection or data exfiltration in this context.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779160224583},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":100,"severity":"CRITICAL","recommendation":"DO_NOT_INSTALL","issueCount":13,"checkedAt":1789022944843},"llm":{"status":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","confidence":"high","summary":"The skill mostly does what it advertises, but it embeds an apparent real API key and encourages sending sensitive content to an external memory service without enough safeguards.","dimensions":[{"detail":"External API transmission is expected for this purpose, but arbitrary memories, search queries, and chat questions are sent to api.supermemory.ai without redaction, confirmation, or clear guidance not to submit secrets.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"No separate installer or dependency bootstrap was found, but the documented setup tells users to export a specific sm_ credential rather than a placeholder, which is unsafe and under-scoped.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The runtime instructions are direct shell-script invocations for three scoped actions; I did not find prompt hijacking, hidden commands, or unrelated behavior, but there is no explicit privacy warning before transmitting user input.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"I found no OS-level persistence, scheduled tasks, privilege escalation, or tool replacement; persistence is limited to remote memory storage through the configured SuperMemory token.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The add, search, and chat scripts are coherent with a SuperMemory integration, but the setup documentation includes an apparent live API credential and the examples encourage storing an API key as memory content.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"concern"}],"guidance":"Review before installing. Use only your own freshly generated SuperMemory API key, do not copy the credential shown in the skill, and do not store passwords, API keys, private keys, tokens, regulated data, or confidential content unless you explicitly intend to send it to SuperMemory. The publisher should rotate the exposed credential, replace it with a placeholder, add privacy and secret-handling warnings, and build JSON requests with a serializer.","findings":"[TP4] expected: Downgraded: the artifact includes add, search, and chat scripts, so the stated feature set is represented by the package.\n[SDI-4] unexpected: Accepted: SKILL.md contains an apparent real SuperMemory bearer credential in setup instructions, which is not needed for a safe public skill and could cause account misuse or user data to be stored under the wrong account.\n[SQP-2] unexpected: Accepted: the documentation explicitly uses an API key as a memory-storage example and lacks clear warnings against storing reusable credentials in the external service.\n[LP3] expected: Partially downgraded: shell execution is visible and limited to bundled scripts, though the package would benefit from explicit permissions metadata.\n[E1] expected: External transmission to SuperMemory is the core function, but it remains a review concern because the skill sends user-provided content and questions without consent prompts or sensitive-data guidance.\n[T09] unexpected: Accepted: the static finding for a hardcoded credential is supported by SKILL.md, and the JSON interpolation findings are real robustness issues for authenticated outbound requests.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789022944843}}}}}